le 3, Parliament has enacted a long series of laws reorganising state boundaries and forming new states since 1951, ranging from minor boundary alterations to major reorganisations like the States Reorganisation Act, 1956 and the Andhra Pradesh Reorganisation Act, 2014.","table":{"headers":["Act","Year","Key Provision"],"rows":[["Assam (Alteration of Boundaries) Act","1951","Ceded a strip of Assam''s territory to Bhutan"],["Andhra State Act","1953","Formed first linguistic state (Andhra), out of Madras"],["Himachal Pradesh and Bilaspur (New State) Act","1954","United Himachal Pradesh and Bilaspur into one state"],["Chandernagore (Merger) Act","1954","Merged Chandernagore (former French enclave) into West Bengal"],["States Reorganisation Act","1956","Created 14 states and 6 UTs; formed Kerala and enlarged Andhra Pradesh"],["Bihar and West Bengal (Transfer of Territories) Act","1956","Transferred territory from Bihar to West Bengal"],["Rajasthan and Madhya Pradesh (Transfer of Territories) Act","1959","Transferred territory from Rajasthan to Madhya Pradesh"],["Andhra Pradesh and Madras (Alteration of Boundaries) Act","1959","Altered boundaries of AP and Madras"],["Bombay Reorganisation Act","1960","Formed Gujarat (15th state); renamed remainder as Maharashtra"],["Acquired Territories (Merger) Act","1960","Merged territories acquired from Pakistan into Assam, Punjab, West Bengal"],["State of Nagaland Act","1962","Formed Nagaland (16th state) from Assam''s Naga Hills-Tuensang Area"],["Punjab Reorganisation Act","1966","Formed Haryana (17th state); made Chandigarh a UT"],["Bihar and Uttar Pradesh (Alteration of Boundaries) Act","1968","Altered boundaries of Bihar and UP"],["Andhra Pradesh and Mysore (Transfer of Territory) Act","1968","Transferred territory from Mysore to AP"],["Madras State (Alteration of Name) Act","1968","Renamed Madras as Tamil Nadu"],["Assam Reorganisation (Meghalaya) Act","1969","Formed Meghalaya as autonomous sub-state within Assam"],["State of Himachal Pradesh Act","1970","Elevated HP to statehood (18th state)"],["North-Eastern Areas (Reorganisation) Act","1971","Elevated Manipur and Tripura to statehood; full statehood to Meghalaya; formed Mizoram and Arunachal Pradesh as UTs"],["Mysore State (Alteration of Name) Act","1973","Renamed Mysore as Karnataka"],["Laccadive, Minicoy and Amindivi Islands (Alteration of Name) Act","1973","Renamed the UT as Lakshadweep"],["Haryana and Uttar Pradesh (Alteration of Boundaries) Act","1979","Altered boundaries of Haryana and UP"],["State of Mizoram Act","1986","Elevated Mizoram to statehood (23rd state)"],["State of Arunachal Pradesh Act","1986","Elevated Arunachal Pradesh to statehood (24th state)"],["Goa, Daman and Diu Reorganisation Act","1987","Formed Goa (25th state) separately from the UT"],["Madhya Pradesh Reorganisation Act","2000","Formed Chhattisgarh (26th state)"],["Uttar Pradesh Reorganisation Act","2000","Formed Uttaranchal (27th state)"],["Bihar Reorganisation Act","2000","Formed Jharkhand (28th state)"],["Uttaranchal (Alteration of Name) Act","2006","Renamed Uttaranchal as Uttarakhand"],["Pondicherry (Alteration of Name) Act","2006","Renamed Pondicherry as Puducherry"],["Orissa (Alteration of Name) Act","2011","Renamed Orissa as Odisha"],["Andhra Pradesh Reorganisation Act","2014","Formed Telangana (29th state)"],["Jammu and Kashmir Reorganisation Act","2019","Bifurcated J&K into UTs of J&K and Ladakh"],["Dadra and Nagar Haveli and Daman and Diu (Merger of Union Territories) Act","2019","Merged the two UTs into one"]]},"type":"mcq","options":{"a":"Acquired Territories (Merger) Act, 1960","b":"Assam Reorganisation (Meghalaya) Act, 1969","c":"Bihar and West Bengal (Transfer of Territories) Act, 1956","d":"Chandernagore (Merger) Act, 1954"},"answer":"d"},{"a":"Article 3","e":"","table":null,"type":"mcq","options":{"a":"Article 4","b":"Article 1","c":"Article 2","d":"Article 3"},"answer":"d"},{"a":"Article 2-A","e":"Article 2-A was inserted by the 35th Consti